{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/943768-promethean-dark-eras","id":943768,"title":"Promethean Dark Eras","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-04T12:18:14-07:00","id":943768,"title":"Promethean Dark Eras","content":"We have a twofold topic here:<br /> <br /> 1) Now that 2e is out, the next big Promethean release is the Dark Eras compainion, with three eras that focus on Promethean (Year Without Summer, 30 Years War, &amp; Black Death with Vampire). What do we know and what do you hope to see? <br /> <br /> 2) If we are so blessed to have Matt and Rich announce at GenCon that there are more Dark Eras coming (and right now I like the odds), what would you hope to see? <br /> <br /> Personally, I'm really hoping we see the Prophets in at least one of the three upcoming Eras. That Lost Lineage section was cool, so I definitely would not be opposed to seeing other previously unmentioned Lineages too. If more Eras are forthcoming, I'd like to see something related to Nuclear Proliferation or the Manhatten Project so that the Zeka can make their way into 2e. I also would like to see the Faceless written up, although really, I'd be happy with a Dark Era book that just covered the Great War worldwide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> 